                  "text": "Same graph, Pre compiled away. The back edge is Temporal → Delayed. Dotted cable + z⁻¹ pill. Still not a solid backward data cable. Use this when the tick is already a Loop iteration; keep an explicit Pre Block when the tick is an external start."
